{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026B5I4YdKzoW1794380340.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，元朗區本月二手交投加快，累錄28宗成交，包括朗怡居1座低層D室，實用面積552平方呎，兩房間隔，議價後以610萬元易手，實用呎價11051元。<br/>王勤學表示，買家為上車客，心儀單位間隔四正實用，加上屋苑位置便利，即決定購入自用。原業主於2025年7月以482萬元買入單位，持貨不足一年半，賬面獲利128萬元，升值26.6%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:23:54.183612+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T13:37:41.606695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:14.964861+00:00","content_hash":"c00143955ed1b04d7da82758ec80578aaf9863430cacbc2e4bd0c1d17aa1ce1e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:23:54.183612+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}